<section class="bg-slate-900 text-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/10 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-200">
          Built to be obvious
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Know exactly who is winning every local rivalry.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80">
          LocalElo keeps match tracking effortless for clubs, gyms, and meetup groups. Set up divisions in minutes, record results without spreadsheets, and keep every player confident that the standings are fair.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <%= link_to 'Create a free account', new_user_registration_path, class: 'inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/30 transition hover:from-purple-400 hover:to-pink-400 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-purple-300' %>
          <%= link_to 'Browse existing clubs', organizations_path, class: 'inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/30 px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white/90 transition hover:border-white hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white' %>
        </div>
        <dl class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4 text-center">
            <dt class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-200">Matches logged</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">50k+</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4 text-center">
            <dt class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-200">Clubs onboard</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">500+</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4 text-center">
            <dt class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-200">Retention lift</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">32%</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 text-slate-900 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Instant standings</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Add a result and see the table update before the next serve.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-white/90 px-4 py-3 shadow">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Carlos Machado</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Advanced division · 32 matches</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2047</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">▲ 12 this week</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-white/80 px-4 py-3 shadow">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Jamie Patel</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Intermediate division · 24 matches</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1924</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">—</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 shadow">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Maya Chen</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Beginner division · 18 matches</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1783</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-rose-500">▼ 4 this week</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-white/60">Players always know what changed and why.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-24" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">The three-step setup</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">Everything is spelled out so club owners never guess what to do next.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-500">Step 1</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Create your ladders</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Name each division and invite players with one link. LocalElo suggests defaults so the structure is obvious.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-500">Step 2</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Record results instantly</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Tap the winner, enter the score, and submit. No dropdown puzzles or hidden options—everything on the form is required and labeled.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-500">Step 3</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Share clear standings</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Players open the dashboard and see their place, movement, and the matches that moved the numbers. No one has to ask "what changed?"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-slate-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Navigation that passes the trunk test</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">LocalElo keeps global navigation, page names, and search tools in the same spot on every screen. Players never wonder where to click next.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="fas fa-check mt-1 text-emerald-500"></i>
            <span><strong class="text-slate-800">Consistent global nav:</strong> Home, Explore, My Organizations, and Matches stay visible so it is impossible to get lost.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="fas fa-check mt-1 text-emerald-500"></i>
            <span><strong class="text-slate-800">Plain-language labels:</strong> No clever names—just the wording users look for.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="fas fa-check mt-1 text-emerald-500"></i>
            <span><strong class="text-slate-800">Search-first approach:</strong> A single search box finds players, matches, and clubs without extra filters.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-lg">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">What club leaders notice</h3>
        <dl class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
            <dt class="font-medium text-slate-700">Less troubleshooting</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-slate-500">Support requests drop once members can answer their own questions in the UI.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
            <dt class="font-medium text-slate-700">More match activity</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-slate-500">Clear standings motivate players to schedule the next challenge immediately.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
            <dt class="font-medium text-slate-700">Happier new members</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-slate-500">A short welcome checklist shows newcomers exactly where to start.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Ready to run a smarter ladder?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">Give players a scoreboard they understand at a glance. It only takes two minutes to create your first organization.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <%= link_to 'Get started now', new_user_registration_path, class: 'inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-slate-700 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-slate-900' %>
        <%= link_to 'See the match log form', new_match_path, class: 'inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:border-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-slate-400' %>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">Prefer a quick overview? <%= link_to 'Jump to the three-step setup', '#how-it-works', class: 'text-slate-700 underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-slate-900' %>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
